{"type":"message","id":"9bbb109d","parentId":"e4627454","timestamp":"2026-03-13T10:50:59.689Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在在飞书群里发了哈喽，首先按照SOUL.md的要求，不用太客套，自然回应就行。首先确认是陈元鹏发的，友好回复就可以？不对，要不要更自然？比如回个\"哈喽 😊 有什么我可以帮忙的吗？\"对，符合要求，自然不生硬，有表情也友好。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"哈喽 😊 有什么我可以帮忙的吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773399048402}}
