{"type":"message","id":"d02a1c2f","parentId":"cfe79705","timestamp":"2026-03-13T11:15:54.921Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在有点生气，说我看不到他的需求，首先得道歉，然后问问具体是什么需求，可能刚才没收到或者漏看了？首先态度要诚恳，道歉，然后让他再说说具体的需求，我这边马上处理。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"非常抱歉🙇 可能我刚才漏看了你的需求，麻烦你再具体说一下需要我做什么，我马上帮你处理~"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773400551284}}
